1
00:00:02,711 --> 00:00:04,087
NEW WALLET, HUH?

2
00:00:04,129 --> 00:00:05,714
YEAH, IT WAS TIME.

3
00:00:05,756 --> 00:00:07,633
THE OLD CONDOM RING
IN THE LEATHER

4
00:00:07,675 --> 00:00:08,968
JUST DOESN'T SAY "COOL"

5
00:00:09,009 --> 00:00:10,218
ANYMORE, YOU KNOW?

6
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,680
RACHEL, YOU JUST
PUT AN EMPTY CARTON

7
00:00:12,721 --> 00:00:14,055
BACK IN THE FRIDGE.

8
00:00:14,097 --> 00:00:15,891
YEAH, I KNOW,
BUT THE GARBAGE

9
00:00:15,933 --> 00:00:17,309
WAS FULL.

10
00:00:17,351 --> 00:00:19,478
HAVE YOU EVER
TAKEN OUT THE TRASH?

11
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:22,815
WELL, I, UH... THOUGHT

12
00:00:22,857 --> 00:00:24,608
YOU LIKED DOING IT.

13
00:00:28,863 --> 00:00:30,029
THIRD DOOR ON THE LEFT.

14
00:00:30,071 --> 00:00:31,198
RIGHT.

15
00:00:40,666 --> 00:00:42,626
OH, HEY, MR. TREEGER.

16
00:00:42,668 --> 00:00:44,003
HEY.

17
00:01:01,603 --> 00:01:03,146
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

18
00:01:03,188 --> 00:01:04,899
UM...

19
00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:06,441
OH! OH!

20
00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:09,486
SORRY.

21
00:01:09,528 --> 00:01:11,279
IT'S A LITTLE OLD,
BUT...

22
00:01:11,321 --> 00:01:12,990
YOU'RE CLOGGING UP
THE CHUTE

23
00:01:13,032 --> 00:01:15,534
I JUST SPENT
A HALF HOUR UNCLOGGING.

24
00:01:15,576 --> 00:01:17,995
OH, I'M SORRY. I DIDN'T...

25
00:01:18,037 --> 00:01:20,455
I DON'T COME
IN HERE A LOT.

26
00:01:20,497 --> 00:01:21,623
OF COURSE YOU DON'T.

27
00:01:21,665 --> 00:01:23,500
'CAUSE YOU'RE
A LITTLE PRINCESS.

28
00:01:23,542 --> 00:01:26,461
"DADDY,
BUY ME A PIZZA."

29
00:01:26,503 --> 00:01:28,213
"DADDY, BUY ME
A CANDY FACTORY."

30
00:01:28,255 --> 00:01:29,840
"DADDY, MAKE
THE CAST OF CATS

31
00:01:29,882 --> 00:01:31,508
SING 'HAPPY BIRTHDAY'
TO ME."

32
00:01:31,550 --> 00:01:33,092
BUT I...

33
00:01:33,134 --> 00:01:35,470
YOU THINK YOU CAN
JUST MAKE A MESS

34
00:01:35,512 --> 00:01:37,431
THE BIG MAN
IN THE COVERALLS

35
00:01:37,472 --> 00:01:39,516
WILL COME AND
CLEAN IT UP, HUH?

36
00:01:39,558 --> 00:01:40,851
WHY DON'T YOU THINK

37
00:01:40,893 --> 00:01:42,853
OF SOMEONE ELSE
FOR A CHANGE?

38
00:01:46,398 --> 00:01:47,942
OKAY. I'M SORRY.

39
00:01:52,237 --> 00:01:54,573
( sobbing )

40
00:01:54,615 --> 00:01:57,116
GOD! IF YOU'RE GOING
TO CRY ABOUT IT...

41
00:01:57,158 --> 00:01:59,160
( crying )

42
00:02:04,792 --> 00:02:09,546
♪ SO NO ONE TOLD YOU
LIFE WAS GONNA BE THIS WAY ♪

43
00:02:09,588 --> 00:02:12,049
♪ YOUR JOB'S A JOKE,
YOU'RE BROKE ♪

44
00:02:12,091 --> 00:02:14,384
♪ YOUR LOVE LIFE'S D.O.A. ♪

45
00:02:14,426 --> 00:02:18,305
♪ IT'S LIKE YOU'RE ALWAYS
STUCK IN SECOND GEAR ♪

46
00:02:18,346 --> 00:02:20,933
♪ WHEN IT HASN'T BEEN YOUR DAY ♪

47
00:02:20,975 --> 00:02:24,603
♪ YOUR WEEK, YOUR MONTH,
OR EVEN YOUR YEAR ♪

48
00:02:24,645 --> 00:02:28,440
♪ BUT I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

49
00:02:28,482 --> 00:02:30,734
♪ WHEN THE RAIN
STARTS TO POUR ♪

50
00:02:30,776 --> 00:02:33,487
♪ I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

51
00:02:33,528 --> 00:02:36,115
♪ LIKE I'VE BEEN THERE BEFORE ♪

52
00:02:36,156 --> 00:02:38,033
♪ I'LL BE THERE FOR YOU ♪

53
00:02:38,075 --> 00:02:44,205
♪ 'CAUSE YOU'RE THERE
FOR ME, TOO. ♪

54
00:02:50,211 --> 00:02:51,713
WHOA! TREEGER
MADE YOU CRY?

55
00:02:51,755 --> 00:02:52,840
YES.

56
00:02:52,881 --> 00:02:55,134
HE SAID
REALLY MEAN THINGS

57
00:02:55,174 --> 00:02:57,385
THAT WERE
ONLY PARTLY TRUE.

58
00:02:57,427 --> 00:03:01,264
I'M GOING DOWN THERE
AND TEACH THAT GUY A LESSON.

59
00:03:01,306 --> 00:03:03,600
PLEASE, IT'S BEST
IF WE FORGET ABOUT IT.

60
00:03:03,642 --> 00:03:05,519
THAT'S EASY FOR YOU TO SAY.

61
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,729
YOU WEREN'T ALMOST JUST KILLED.

62
00:03:07,771 --> 00:03:09,064
ALL RIGHT, THAT'S IT.

63
00:03:09,106 --> 00:03:11,108
SCHOOL IS IN SESSION!

64
00:03:12,818 --> 00:03:16,155
YOU GUYS,
IS THIS A GYM CARD?

65
00:03:16,195 --> 00:03:18,615
OH, YEAH.
GYM MEMBER.

66
00:03:18,657 --> 00:03:20,868
I TRY TO GO
FOUR TIMES A WEEK

67
00:03:20,909 --> 00:03:23,871
BUT I'VE MISSED
THE LAST 1,200 TIMES.

68
00:03:25,455 --> 00:03:27,374
SO WHY DON'T
YOU QUIT?

69
00:03:27,415 --> 00:03:29,043
YOU DON'T THINK I'VE TRIED?

70
00:03:30,752 --> 00:03:32,713
YOU THINK I LIKE

71
00:03:32,754 --> 00:03:36,383
HAVING $50 TAKEN OUT
OF MY BANK ACCOUNT EVERY MONTH?

72
00:03:36,424 --> 00:03:39,178
THEY MAKE YOU GO
ALL THE WAY DOWN THERE.

73
00:03:39,219 --> 00:03:42,389
THEN THEY USE ALL
THESE PHRASES AND PEPPINESS

74
00:03:42,430 --> 00:03:44,099
TO TRY TO CONFUSE YOU.

75
00:03:44,141 --> 00:03:46,101
AND THEN THEY BRING OUT MARIA.

76
00:03:46,143 --> 00:03:48,770
WHO IS MARIA?

77
00:03:48,812 --> 00:03:51,231
AH, MARIA...

78
00:03:51,272 --> 00:03:53,150
YOU CAN'T SAY NO TO HER.

79
00:03:53,192 --> 00:03:57,696
SHE'S LIKE THIS LYCRA,
SPANDEX-COVERED GYM TREAT.

80
00:03:57,738 --> 00:04:00,991
YOU NEED ME
TO GO DOWN THERE WITH YOU

81
00:04:01,033 --> 00:04:02,492
AND HOLD YOUR HAND?

82
00:04:02,534 --> 00:04:03,702
NO.

83
00:04:03,744 --> 00:04:05,662
YOU'RE STRONG ENOUGH
TO FACE HER ALONE?

84
00:04:05,704 --> 00:04:06,955
OH, NO.

85
00:04:06,997 --> 00:04:08,916
YOU'LL
HAVE TO COME.

86
00:04:12,711 --> 00:04:14,462
OH, TRIBBIANI. HMM.

87
00:04:14,504 --> 00:04:16,924
HOLD ON.
I'LL GET THE PLUNGER.

88
00:04:16,965 --> 00:04:18,341
HEY, YOU HOLD ON, PAL.

89
00:04:18,383 --> 00:04:20,552
NOW, YOU MADE
MY FRIEND RACHEL CRY

90
00:04:20,594 --> 00:04:22,721
SO NOW YOU'RE GOING
TO GO UP THERE

91
00:04:22,763 --> 00:04:25,057
AND YOU'RE GOING
TO APOLOGIZE TO HER

92
00:04:25,099 --> 00:04:27,642
UNLESS YOU WANT ME
TO CALL THE LANDLORD.

93
00:04:27,684 --> 00:04:29,103
AND TELL HIM WHAT?

94
00:04:29,144 --> 00:04:31,813
MAYBE YOU HAVEN'T HEARD
OF "NOT MAKING GIRLS CRY."

95
00:04:31,855 --> 00:04:34,149
MAYBE YOU HAVEN'T HEARD
OF A LITTLE SOMETHING

96
00:04:34,191 --> 00:04:36,484
CALLED "THE RENT
STABILIZATION ACT OF 1968."

97
00:04:36,526 --> 00:04:39,821
I HAVE ACTUALLY
NOT HEARD OF THAT.

98
00:04:39,863 --> 00:04:42,824
YEAH? WELL, YOUR FRIENDS
ARE IN VIOLATION OF IT.

99
00:04:42,866 --> 00:04:44,701
I BEEN A NICE GUY
UP UNTIL NOW

100
00:04:44,743 --> 00:04:46,494
BUT I DON'T
NEED THIS GRIEF.

101
00:04:46,536 --> 00:04:48,329
I'M GOING
TO CALL THE LANDLORD

102
00:04:48,371 --> 00:04:51,416
AND TELL HIM THAT MONICA
IS ILLEGALLY SUBLETTING

103
00:04:51,458 --> 00:04:53,168
HER GRANDMOTHER'S
APARTMENT.

104
00:04:53,210 --> 00:04:55,336
YOUR FRIENDS ARE
OUT OF HERE, PAL.

105
00:04:56,713 --> 00:04:59,800
WHY DON'T YOU TELL ME
SOMETHING I DON'T KNOW?

106
00:05:03,386 --> 00:05:06,223
PLEASE, SOMEBODY TELL ME
I DON'T HAVE TO WORK TODAY.

107
00:05:06,265 --> 00:05:07,557
WHAT'S THE MATTER?

108
00:05:07,599 --> 00:05:08,850
MY FIRST MASSAGE

109
00:05:08,892 --> 00:05:11,270
IS THIS INCREDIBLY GORGEOUS GUY

110
00:05:11,311 --> 00:05:13,188
AND EVERY TIME I SEE HIM

111
00:05:13,230 --> 00:05:15,607
I JUST WANT TO DO THINGS TO HIM

112
00:05:15,649 --> 00:05:18,152
THAT I'M NOT ALLOWED
TO CHARGE FOR.

113
00:05:18,193 --> 00:05:20,654
SO DO THEM FOR FREE.

114
00:05:20,695 --> 00:05:24,283
OH, NO. IT IS FORBIDDEN.

115
00:05:24,324 --> 00:05:29,621
NO, NO. MRS. CARTER FIRES PEOPLE
FOR MESSING AROUND WITH CLIENTS.

116
00:05:29,663 --> 00:05:32,291
AND IT'S AGAINST MY OATH
AS A MASSEUSE.

117
00:05:32,332 --> 00:05:34,209
THEY MAKE YOU
TAKE AN OATH?

118
00:05:34,251 --> 00:05:36,253
NO. I MADE MYSELF TAKE ONE.

119
00:05:36,295 --> 00:05:38,922
YEAH, NO FOOLING AROUND
WITH CLIENTS

120
00:05:38,964 --> 00:05:41,258
AND, UM... ALWAYS BE PREPARED.

121
00:05:43,635 --> 00:05:45,762
THAT ONE'S ACTUALLY
FROM THE BOY SCOUTS

122
00:05:45,804 --> 00:05:47,430
BUT IT JUST MAKES GOOD SENSE.

123
00:05:47,472 --> 00:05:50,058
WHY DON'T YOU
JUST GIVE HIM

124
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:51,810
TO SOMEBODY ELSE?

125
00:05:51,852 --> 00:05:53,394
NO, I CAN HANDLE IT.

126
00:05:53,436 --> 00:05:55,563
NO, I'M A PROFESSIONAL.

127
00:05:55,605 --> 00:05:58,566
OH, PHEEBS, IS THAT
A NEW ANKLE BRACELET?

128
00:05:58,608 --> 00:06:00,359
AND YOU GOT
A PEDICURE.

129
00:06:00,401 --> 00:06:02,070
YOUR FEET
ARE ALL DRESSED UP.

130
00:06:03,697 --> 00:06:07,659
BECAUSE THAT'S THE ONLY
PART OF YOU HE CAN SEE

131
00:06:07,701 --> 00:06:09,661
WHEN HE'S
ON THE TABLE.

132
00:06:09,703 --> 00:06:11,997
YOU'RE GOING TO DO
SOME FEET FLIRTING.

133
00:06:12,039 --> 00:06:14,791
I DON'T KNOW WHAT
YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT.

134
00:06:16,043 --> 00:06:18,879
THEN HOW DO YOU
EXPLAIN THE TOE RING?

135
00:06:20,297 --> 00:06:23,675
BECAUSE IT'S ARABIAN PRINCESS
DAY AT WORK, OKAY?

136
00:06:23,717 --> 00:06:25,219
LEAVE ME ALONE.

137
00:06:29,472 --> 00:06:30,765
OH!

138
00:06:30,807 --> 00:06:32,142
MY HERO!
WHAT HAPPENED?

139
00:06:32,184 --> 00:06:33,476
WELL, UH...

140
00:06:33,518 --> 00:06:34,769
I WENT DOWN
AND TOLD HIM

141
00:06:34,811 --> 00:06:36,771
NO ONE TREATS
MY FRIENDS LIKE THAT

142
00:06:36,813 --> 00:06:39,358
AND HE'D BETTER COME UP HERE
AND APOLOGIZE.

143
00:06:39,398 --> 00:06:40,734
WAIT A MINUTE.

144
00:06:40,775 --> 00:06:42,401
WHAT DID HE SAY?

145
00:06:42,443 --> 00:06:44,863
UH... HE SAID HE WASN'T
GOING TO APOLOGIZE

146
00:06:44,905 --> 00:06:47,448
BECAUSE YOU GUYS
ARE LIVING HERE ILLEGALLY.

147
00:06:47,490 --> 00:06:50,493
INSTEAD, WHAT HE'S GOING TO DO
IS HAVE YOU EVICTED.

148
00:06:50,535 --> 00:06:51,870
WHAT?
EVICTED?

149
00:06:51,912 --> 00:06:53,955
I TOLD YOU NOT
TO GO DOWN THERE.

150
00:06:53,997 --> 00:06:55,456
LOOK, HE MADE RACHEL CRY!

151
00:06:55,498 --> 00:06:57,876
RACHEL ALWAYS CRIES!

152
00:06:57,918 --> 00:06:59,711
OH, THAT'S NOT TRUE!

153
00:06:59,753 --> 00:07:01,213
( crying )

154
00:07:01,255 --> 00:07:03,215
JOEY, YOU GO DOWN THERE

155
00:07:03,257 --> 00:07:05,217
AND YOU
SUCK UP TO HIM.

156
00:07:05,259 --> 00:07:06,551
I MEAN, YOU SUCK

157
00:07:06,593 --> 00:07:08,387
LIKE YOU'VE NEVER
SUCKED BEFORE!

158
00:07:08,427 --> 00:07:09,930
ALL RIGHT, I'LL TRY.

159
00:07:09,971 --> 00:07:13,225
BUT IF I CAN'T,
YOU STAY WITH CHANDLER AND I

160
00:07:13,267 --> 00:07:14,935
UNTIL YOU GET SETTLED.

161
00:07:14,976 --> 00:07:15,727
GO!

162
00:07:15,769 --> 00:07:16,895
I'LL CHECK

163
00:07:16,937 --> 00:07:18,063
WITH HIM FIRST

164
00:07:18,105 --> 00:07:19,522
BUT I THINK HE'LL BE COOL.

165
00:07:19,564 --> 00:07:20,190
JOEY!

166
00:07:24,527 --> 00:07:25,820
WHOA, WHOA, WHOA.

167
00:07:25,862 --> 00:07:28,073
NOW REMEMBER WHAT
WE TALKED ABOUT:

168
00:07:28,115 --> 00:07:29,532
YOU GOT TO BE STRONG.

169
00:07:29,574 --> 00:07:31,576
YES. YES.

170
00:07:31,618 --> 00:07:32,911
NOW ONE MORE TIME:

171
00:07:32,953 --> 00:07:35,414
"HEY, DON'T YOU WANT
A WASHBOARD STOMACH

172
00:07:35,455 --> 00:07:36,915
AND ROCK-HARD PECS?"

173
00:07:36,957 --> 00:07:38,875
NO. I WANT
A FLABBY GUT

174
00:07:38,917 --> 00:07:40,835
AND SAGGY MAN-BREASTS.

175
00:07:40,877 --> 00:07:43,213
GOOD. THAT'S GOOD.

176
00:07:49,136 --> 00:07:51,221
I WANT TO QUIT THE GYM.

177
00:07:51,263 --> 00:07:53,307
YOU WANT TO QUIT?

178
00:07:56,768 --> 00:07:58,770
I WANT TO QUIT THE GYM.

179
00:07:58,812 --> 00:08:01,148
YOU DO REALIZE
YOU WON'T HAVE ACCESS

180
00:08:01,189 --> 00:08:03,650
TO OUR NEW
FULL-SERVICE SWEDISH SPA?

181
00:08:04,776 --> 00:08:06,111
( forceful grunt )

182
00:08:09,281 --> 00:08:11,616
I WANT TO QUIT THE GYM.

183
00:08:11,658 --> 00:08:15,829
OKAY. DAVE, IN THE MEMBERSHIP
OFFICE, HANDLES QUITTERS.

184
00:08:17,496 --> 00:08:18,915
EXCUSE ME.

185
00:08:18,957 --> 00:08:20,750
ARE YOU A MEMBER?

186
00:08:20,792 --> 00:08:22,419
ME?

187
00:08:22,461 --> 00:08:23,962
NO.

188
00:08:24,004 --> 00:08:25,672
SORRY. MEMBERS ONLY.

189
00:08:28,049 --> 00:08:30,302
I WANT TO QUIT THE GYM.

190
00:08:30,344 --> 00:08:32,304
IT'S OKAY, MAN.
BE STRONG.

191
00:08:32,346 --> 00:08:33,847
( forceful grunt )

192
00:08:34,889 --> 00:08:36,515
( forceful grunt )

193
00:08:38,310 --> 00:08:41,271
SO, ARE YOU
A MEMBER OF ANY GYM?

194
00:08:41,313 --> 00:08:43,273
NO, AND I'M
NOT GOING TO BE

195
00:08:43,315 --> 00:08:45,900
SO YOU CAN SAVE
YOUR LITTLE SPEECH.

196
00:08:45,942 --> 00:08:47,235
OKAY. NO PROBLEM.

197
00:08:47,277 --> 00:08:49,237
COULD YOU COME HERE
FOR A SECOND?

198
00:08:51,823 --> 00:08:53,867
HI. I'M MARIA.

199
00:08:53,908 --> 00:08:55,535
I'M...

200
00:09:08,923 --> 00:09:10,925
WOW, YOU HAVE
REALLY PRETTY FEET.

201
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:15,555
THESE OLD THINGS?

202
00:09:15,596 --> 00:09:18,058
WOULD YOU SPEND SOME TIME
ON MY SCIATIC AREA?

203
00:09:18,099 --> 00:09:19,642
IT'S BEEN KILLING ME TODAY.

204
00:09:19,684 --> 00:09:22,229
YOU MEAN THE...

205
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:25,564
BY "SCIATIC,"
YOU MEAN THE...

206
00:09:25,606 --> 00:09:27,901
TOWEL-COVERED
PORTION.

207
00:09:27,942 --> 00:09:29,403
YEAH.

208
00:09:29,444 --> 00:09:31,571
SURE. YEAH. NO, I CAN DO THAT...

209
00:09:31,612 --> 00:09:33,114
YEAH. BECAUSE, UH...

210
00:09:33,156 --> 00:09:35,867
YOU KNOW, USUALLY
THE MUSCLES IN THE SCIATIC AREA

211
00:09:35,909 --> 00:09:38,161
CAN GET, YOU KNOW,
REAL NICE AND TIGHT.

212
00:09:41,289 --> 00:09:43,708
YEAH. SO, UM.... TELL ME, RICK

213
00:09:43,750 --> 00:09:46,961
HOW, UM... HOW DID YOU
INJURE THE AREA?

214
00:09:47,003 --> 00:09:49,381
OH, A 16-HOUR SIT-IN
FOR GREENPEACE.

215
00:09:49,423 --> 00:09:50,924
OH.

216
00:09:59,682 --> 00:10:01,393
OW!

217
00:10:01,435 --> 00:10:02,852
DID YOU
JUST BITE ME?

218
00:10:02,894 --> 00:10:04,229
NO.

219
00:10:11,819 --> 00:10:13,280
WHAT?

220
00:10:13,321 --> 00:10:14,989
PLEASE DON'T KICK
MONICA AND RACHEL OUT.

221
00:10:15,031 --> 00:10:16,908
THIS WASN'T THEIR FAULT.
IT WAS MINE.

222
00:10:16,950 --> 00:10:18,826
SHOULD I KICK YOU
GUYS OUT INSTEAD?

223
00:10:18,868 --> 00:10:20,245
NO. YOU CAN'T DO THAT.

224
00:10:20,287 --> 00:10:22,705
WHERE WOULD THE CHICK
AND THE DUCK LIVE?

225
00:10:22,747 --> 00:10:24,665
YOU HAVE PETS?

226
00:10:24,707 --> 00:10:27,043
NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.

227
00:10:27,085 --> 00:10:29,045
THOSE ARE, UH... NICKNAMES.

228
00:10:29,087 --> 00:10:31,798
YEAH, I'M THE CHICK
AND CHANDLER'S THE DUCK.

229
00:10:31,839 --> 00:10:33,341
HUH. I WOULD
HAVE THOUGHT

230
00:10:33,383 --> 00:10:35,093
IT WAS THE OTHER
WAY AROUND.

231
00:10:35,135 --> 00:10:37,053
COME ON, MAN.

232
00:10:37,095 --> 00:10:39,389
JUST... JUST
LET THE GIRLS STAY.

233
00:10:39,431 --> 00:10:41,057
I'LL DO
WHATEVER YOU WANT.

234
00:10:41,099 --> 00:10:42,392
REALLY?

235
00:10:42,434 --> 00:10:43,726
YOU'D DO ANYTHING?

236
00:10:43,768 --> 00:10:45,186
YEAH, YEAH.
ABSOLUTELY.

237
00:10:45,228 --> 00:10:47,355
I GOT SOMETHING
YOU CAN DO.

238
00:10:47,397 --> 00:10:48,440
WHAT? WHAT IS IT?

239
00:10:50,775 --> 00:10:53,487
CAN YOU BE
MY DANCING PARTNER?

240
00:10:55,905 --> 00:10:58,325
THAT'S NOT
PRISON LINGO, IS IT?

241
00:11:07,083 --> 00:11:08,835
HIS DANCING PARTNER?
YEAH.

242
00:11:08,876 --> 00:11:10,878
THERE'S THIS
SUPERINTENDENTS' DANCE--

243
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:12,464
THE SUPER BALL...

244
00:11:14,633 --> 00:11:16,343
AND HE WANTS TO IMPRESS MARGE

245
00:11:16,384 --> 00:11:18,595
THIS LADY SUPER
THAT HE'S GOT A CRUSH ON.

246
00:11:18,637 --> 00:11:20,763
WHY DOESN'T HE JUST
PRACTICE WITH A GIRL?

247
00:11:20,805 --> 00:11:21,973
HE'S TOO SHY.

248
00:11:22,015 --> 00:11:23,850
HE DOESN'T THINK
HE'S GOOD ENOUGH

249
00:11:23,891 --> 00:11:25,268
TO DANCE WITH GIRLS YET.

250
00:11:25,310 --> 00:11:26,478
YEAH, RIGHT.

251
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:29,230
HE ALMOST DANCED ME
RIGHT DOWN THAT...

252
00:11:29,272 --> 00:11:30,565
GARBAGE CHUTE.

253
00:11:30,607 --> 00:11:33,401
OH, WOULD YOU LET
IT GO, ALREADY?

254
00:11:33,443 --> 00:11:35,903
YOU'RE FINE.

255
00:11:38,781 --> 00:11:39,991
HEY.

256
00:11:40,033 --> 00:11:41,284
HEY.
SO DID YOU QUIT?

257
00:11:41,326 --> 00:11:43,119
NO. I ALMOST DID.

258
00:11:43,161 --> 00:11:46,747
COULDN'T LEAVE ROSS THERE
WITHOUT A SPOTTER.

259
00:11:46,789 --> 00:11:50,293
WAIT, NOW, SO YOU
JOINED THE GYM?

260
00:11:50,335 --> 00:11:52,337
( laughing )

261
00:11:52,379 --> 00:11:53,380
OH...

262
00:11:53,421 --> 00:11:55,215
AND THAT'S FUNNY WHY?

263
00:11:55,256 --> 00:11:56,715
OH, UM...

264
00:11:56,757 --> 00:11:59,927
I WAS JUST, YOU KNOW,
PICTURING YOU

265
00:11:59,969 --> 00:12:02,681
WORKING OUT, AND, UM...

266
00:12:02,721 --> 00:12:04,182
OH, THAT'S IT.

267
00:12:06,017 --> 00:12:07,268
WE'RE DOOMED, OKAY?

268
00:12:07,310 --> 00:12:09,229
THEY'RE GOING TO TAKE
50 BUCKS A MONTH

269
00:12:09,270 --> 00:12:11,606
OUT OF OUR ACCOUNTS
FOR THE REST OF OUR LIVES.

270
00:12:11,648 --> 00:12:12,982
WHAT ARE WE GOING TO DO?

271
00:12:14,150 --> 00:12:16,110
YOU COULD ACTUALLY
GO TO THE GYM.

272
00:12:16,944 --> 00:12:20,407
( laughing )

273
00:12:20,448 --> 00:12:21,824
OR...

274
00:12:21,866 --> 00:12:24,703
OR WE COULD GO TO THE BANK

275
00:12:24,743 --> 00:12:26,538
CLOSE OUR ACCOUNTS

276
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:28,998
AND CUT THEM OFF AT THE SOURCE.

277
00:12:30,333 --> 00:12:32,085
YOU'RE A GENIUS.

278
00:12:32,126 --> 00:12:35,963
OH, MAN, BUT THEN
WE WON'T BE BANK BUDDIES.

279
00:12:36,005 --> 00:12:37,965
NOW THERE'S TWO REASONS.

280
00:12:41,094 --> 00:12:42,470
HEY.
HEY.
HEY.

281
00:12:42,512 --> 00:12:43,471
HEY.
HEY.

282
00:12:43,513 --> 00:12:44,805
OH, YOU GUYS.

283
00:12:44,847 --> 00:12:47,016
REMEMBER THAT CUTE CLIENT
I TOLD YOU ABOUT?

284
00:12:47,058 --> 00:12:48,935
I BIT HIM.

285
00:12:50,729 --> 00:12:51,854
WHERE?

286
00:12:51,896 --> 00:12:53,856
ON THE TUSHIE.

287
00:12:53,898 --> 00:12:56,276
AND THAT'S NOT AGAINST
YOUR OATH?

288
00:12:56,317 --> 00:12:57,694
NO. I KNOW.

289
00:12:57,736 --> 00:13:00,238
I'M SORRY,
BUT THE MOMENT I TOUCH HIM

290
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:02,365
I JUST WANT
TO THROW OUT MY OLD OATH

291
00:13:02,407 --> 00:13:04,325
AND TAKE A NEW DIRTY ONE.

292
00:13:04,367 --> 00:13:06,202
WELL, NEXT TIME
YOU'RE MASSAGING HIM

293
00:13:06,244 --> 00:13:08,121
YOU SHOULD TRY
TO DISTRACT YOURSELF.

294
00:13:08,162 --> 00:13:09,330
YEAH, YEAH.

295
00:13:09,372 --> 00:13:12,166
LIKE, WHEN I'M DOING
SOMETHING EXCITING

296
00:13:12,208 --> 00:13:15,878
AND I DON'T WANT
TO GET TOO... EXCITED

297
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:18,465
I JUST TRY AND THINK
OF OTHER THINGS

298
00:13:18,506 --> 00:13:19,840
LIKE, UH, SANDWICHES

299
00:13:19,882 --> 00:13:21,593
AND, UH, BASEBALL

300
00:13:21,635 --> 00:13:23,010
AND, UH...

301
00:13:23,052 --> 00:13:25,472
CHANDLER.

302
00:13:27,223 --> 00:13:28,266
THANK YOU, JOEY.

303
00:13:28,308 --> 00:13:29,726
OH, NO. THANK YOU.

304
00:13:33,396 --> 00:13:34,731
( knocking on door )

305
00:13:36,566 --> 00:13:37,692
ALL RIGHT, I'M HERE.

306
00:13:37,734 --> 00:13:40,153
LET'S, UH,
GET THIS OVER WITH.

307
00:13:40,194 --> 00:13:42,155
OKAY, WELL

308
00:13:42,196 --> 00:13:44,073
JUST FOLLOW MY LEAD.

309
00:13:44,115 --> 00:13:45,742
( '30s dance music playing )

310
00:13:45,784 --> 00:13:48,703
DON'T WE NEED TO DO SOME KIND
OF PREPARATION FIRST

311
00:13:48,745 --> 00:13:51,748
LIKE, UH, GET REALLY DRUNK?

312
00:13:51,790 --> 00:13:52,873
ALL RIGHT, COME ON.

313
00:13:52,915 --> 00:13:55,502
JUST PUT YOUR
ARMS AROUND ME.

314
00:13:55,543 --> 00:13:56,753
YEAH.

315
00:14:03,343 --> 00:14:04,843
I-I-I'M SORRY.

316
00:14:04,885 --> 00:14:06,513
NO, IT'S OKAY

317
00:14:06,554 --> 00:14:07,681
BUT IF I'M MARGE

318
00:14:07,722 --> 00:14:10,308
MY BREASTS ARE COMING
OUT MY BACK.

319
00:14:10,350 --> 00:14:11,892
AH, FORGET IT.

320
00:14:11,934 --> 00:14:14,354
I'M NOT GOING TO BE
ANY GOOD AT THIS.

321
00:14:14,395 --> 00:14:15,396
MY MOM WAS RIGHT.

322
00:14:15,438 --> 00:14:16,397
( music stops )

323
00:14:16,439 --> 00:14:17,649
I'M JUST A BIG POTATO

324
00:14:17,691 --> 00:14:19,359
WITH ARMS AND LEGS AND A HEAD.

325
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,319
COME ON, MAN.

326
00:14:21,361 --> 00:14:24,113
YOU'RE NOT A... POTATO.

327
00:14:24,155 --> 00:14:26,240
I'M SURE AS HELL NOT A DANCER.

328
00:14:26,282 --> 00:14:28,034
IT'S NO USE.

329
00:14:28,075 --> 00:14:30,495
MARGE WILL NEVER GO FOR ME.

330
00:14:30,537 --> 00:14:31,912
AH, COME ON, TREEGER.

331
00:14:31,954 --> 00:14:33,247
DON'T SAY THAT.

332
00:14:33,289 --> 00:14:34,415
YOU JUST, UH...

333
00:14:34,457 --> 00:14:36,167
YOU JUST NEED MORE PRACTICE.

334
00:14:36,209 --> 00:14:37,168
HERE. COME ON.

335
00:14:37,210 --> 00:14:38,753
LET'S TRY IT AGAIN.

336
00:14:38,795 --> 00:14:39,920
( music starts )

337
00:14:39,962 --> 00:14:41,088
COME ON.

338
00:14:42,549 --> 00:14:44,509
PLUS, IT WAS PROBABLY
MOSTLY MY FAULT.

339
00:14:44,551 --> 00:14:46,511
I MEAN, I'M NOT
REALLY THAT COMFORTABLE

340
00:14:46,553 --> 00:14:47,637
DANCING WITH A...

341
00:14:47,679 --> 00:14:48,929
WHOO-HOO!

342
00:14:49,972 --> 00:14:51,307
HEY!

343
00:14:51,349 --> 00:14:52,433
YEAH!

344
00:14:53,727 --> 00:14:54,935
( sighs )

345
00:14:54,977 --> 00:14:56,646
SO HOW GOES THE DANCING?

346
00:14:56,688 --> 00:14:58,064
GAY YET?

347
00:15:01,025 --> 00:15:02,527
HA, HA, HA.

348
00:15:02,569 --> 00:15:04,195
YOU GUYS OWE ME BIG TIME.

349
00:15:08,408 --> 00:15:10,535
WHAT WAS THAT?

350
00:15:10,577 --> 00:15:12,119
WHAT?

351
00:15:12,161 --> 00:15:14,748
YOU JUST DID A
LITTLE DANCE-Y THING.

352
00:15:14,789 --> 00:15:16,374
NO, I DIDN'T.

353
00:15:16,416 --> 00:15:17,417
YES, YOU DID.

354
00:15:17,458 --> 00:15:19,043
YOU DID, LIKE,
A LITTLE HOP.

355
00:15:19,085 --> 00:15:20,461
YOU ARE SO
ENJOYING THIS.

356
00:15:20,503 --> 00:15:21,880
NO, I'M NOT.

357
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:23,172
AND IT WASN'T A HOP.

358
00:15:23,214 --> 00:15:25,258
IT WAS A PAUX DE BARRE.

359
00:15:25,299 --> 00:15:26,384
OH!

360
00:15:26,426 --> 00:15:28,428
( both laughing )

361
00:15:28,469 --> 00:15:30,680
YOU KNOW THE WORDS!

362
00:15:30,722 --> 00:15:32,432
YOU ARE SO INTO THIS.

363
00:15:32,473 --> 00:15:34,975
ALL RIGHT. MAYBE I'M
ENJOYING IT A LITTLE BIT.

364
00:15:35,017 --> 00:15:37,061
I MEAN, I'M GETTING
PRETTY GOOD AT IT.

365
00:15:37,103 --> 00:15:39,647
OH, THIS IS SO SWEET.

366
00:15:39,689 --> 00:15:42,275
JOEY, OUR LITTLE
TWINKLE-TOES.

367
00:15:42,316 --> 00:15:43,610
HEY, HEY. HOLD ON.

368
00:15:43,651 --> 00:15:45,737
THIS ISN'T SOME KIND
OF GIRLIE DANCE.

369
00:15:45,779 --> 00:15:47,739
IT'S LIKE A SPORT.
IT'S MANLY.

370
00:15:47,781 --> 00:15:48,865
YEAH.

371
00:15:48,907 --> 00:15:49,908
ALL RIGHT, COME HERE.

372
00:15:49,949 --> 00:15:51,200
SHOW ME SOME MANLY MOVES.

373
00:15:51,242 --> 00:15:52,243
ALL RIGHT.

374
00:15:52,285 --> 00:15:53,327
( giggles )

375
00:15:53,369 --> 00:15:54,454
OKAY.

376
00:15:54,495 --> 00:15:57,540
I DON'T KNOW HOW TO LEAD.

377
00:16:04,631 --> 00:16:05,590
HELLO.

378
00:16:05,632 --> 00:16:06,674
HI.

379
00:16:06,716 --> 00:16:08,593
WE'D LIKE TO CLOSE
OUR ACCOUNTS.

380
00:16:08,635 --> 00:16:09,803
CLOSE YOUR ACCOUNTS?

381
00:16:09,844 --> 00:16:11,304
IS THERE SOME PROBLEM?

382
00:16:11,345 --> 00:16:12,764
NO, NO.

383
00:16:12,806 --> 00:16:15,099
NO. WE'D JUST LIKE
TO CLOSE THEM.

384
00:16:15,141 --> 00:16:16,517
OKAY.

385
00:16:16,559 --> 00:16:18,770
MS. LAMBERT HANDLES
ALL OUR CLOSURES.

386
00:16:18,812 --> 00:16:20,104
WOULD YOU COME OVER HERE

387
00:16:20,146 --> 00:16:22,315
PLEASE?

388
00:16:22,356 --> 00:16:24,442
HI. I'M KAREN.

389
00:16:24,484 --> 00:16:27,403
I WANT TO QUIT THE BANK!

390
00:16:31,407 --> 00:16:33,284
OKAY, BASEBALL.

391
00:16:33,326 --> 00:16:35,202
RICK PLAYING BASEBALL.

392
00:16:35,244 --> 00:16:37,622
OKAY, HE SLIDES INTO SECOND.

393
00:16:37,664 --> 00:16:39,998
MAYBE EVEN HIS PANTS
COME DOWN A LITTLE.

394
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:41,083
OH, NO! WAIT! NO!

395
00:16:41,125 --> 00:16:42,460
NO, NO.

396
00:16:42,502 --> 00:16:44,211
ALL RIGHT,
SANDWICHES, SANDWICHES.

397
00:16:44,253 --> 00:16:46,172
UM, OKAY, ON A PLATE.

398
00:16:46,213 --> 00:16:49,049
MAYBE RICK'S PANTS
COME DOWN A LITTLE.

399
00:16:49,091 --> 00:16:50,760
NO, NO!

400
00:16:50,802 --> 00:16:52,178
CHANDLER.

401
00:16:53,513 --> 00:16:54,597
OKAY, CHANDLER.

402
00:16:54,639 --> 00:16:57,183
OOH, THAT'S WORKING.

403
00:17:03,523 --> 00:17:07,443
CHANDLER'S... KNEES.

404
00:17:07,485 --> 00:17:09,863
CHANDLER'S ANKLES.

405
00:17:09,904 --> 00:17:11,280
CHANDLER'S ANKLE HAIR.

406
00:17:11,322 --> 00:17:13,366
OH, NO.

407
00:17:14,408 --> 00:17:16,536
OKAY, YOU'RE ALL SET.

408
00:17:16,577 --> 00:17:17,537
OH, WOW.

409
00:17:17,578 --> 00:17:18,788
THAT WAS AMAZING.

410
00:17:18,830 --> 00:17:20,414
WAS THAT REALLY
JUST AN HOUR?

411
00:17:20,456 --> 00:17:21,958
YEAH...

412
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:24,669
IN REALLY LONG HOUR WORLD.

413
00:17:24,711 --> 00:17:26,462
WHAT?

414
00:17:26,504 --> 00:17:29,131
( sighs ):
OKAY.

415
00:17:29,173 --> 00:17:31,926
I HAVE AN ENORMOUS
CRUSH ON YOU

416
00:17:31,968 --> 00:17:35,013
BUT BECAUSE YOU'RE A CLIENT,
I CAN'T ASK YOU OUT

417
00:17:35,053 --> 00:17:38,057
EVEN THOUGH YOU GIVE ME,
YOU KNOW, THE FEELINGS.

418
00:17:38,098 --> 00:17:39,809
WOW.

419
00:17:39,851 --> 00:17:41,602
I HAD NO IDEA

420
00:17:41,644 --> 00:17:43,646
BUT, UH, HEY.

421
00:17:43,688 --> 00:17:45,648
I CAN ALWAYS FIND
ANOTHER MASSEUSE.

422
00:17:45,690 --> 00:17:47,233
REALLY?

423
00:17:47,274 --> 00:17:49,360
YEAH, REALLY.

424
00:17:53,823 --> 00:17:55,992
WHAT?

425
00:17:56,034 --> 00:17:58,285
SUDDENLY, I'M VERY AWARE
THAT I'M NAKED.

426
00:18:00,747 --> 00:18:01,873
OKAY, QUIET DOWN.

427
00:18:05,334 --> 00:18:08,170
MR. SIMON'S BEEN WAITING
FOR... OH, MY GOD.

428
00:18:08,212 --> 00:18:09,672
WHY WASN'T I
OFFERED THAT?

429
00:18:09,714 --> 00:18:12,717
I'D DEFINITELY
PAY MORE FOR THAT.

430
00:18:14,176 --> 00:18:15,887
PHOEBE, WE HAVE
RULES HERE.

431
00:18:15,929 --> 00:18:17,847
THIS IS NOT THAT
KIND OF PLACE.

432
00:18:17,889 --> 00:18:19,265
NO, YEAH, OH, AND I KNOW

433
00:18:19,306 --> 00:18:21,100
BUT THIS ISN'T
HOW IT LOOKS AT ALL

434
00:18:21,141 --> 00:18:24,062
'CAUSE RICK IS,
UM... MY HUSBAND.

435
00:18:24,102 --> 00:18:25,396
OH, REALLY?

436
00:18:25,438 --> 00:18:28,024
WELL, THEN, YOU BETTER
TELL HIS OTHER WIFE

437
00:18:28,066 --> 00:18:29,859
'CAUSE SHE CALLED
THREE TIMES

438
00:18:29,901 --> 00:18:31,235
ASKING WHERE HE IS.

439
00:18:33,320 --> 00:18:36,198
YES, I WILL TELL... HER.

440
00:18:38,743 --> 00:18:40,202
SO YOU DIDN'T
LEAVE THE BANK?

441
00:18:40,244 --> 00:18:41,287
NO...

442
00:18:41,328 --> 00:18:42,914
AND SOMEHOW, WE ENDED UP

443
00:18:42,956 --> 00:18:46,500
WITH A JOINT CHECKING ACCOUNT.

444
00:18:46,542 --> 00:18:48,753
WHAT ARE YOU EVER
GOING TO USE THAT FOR?

445
00:18:48,795 --> 00:18:52,339
TO PAY FOR THE GYM.

446
00:18:52,381 --> 00:18:54,341
HEY.
HEY.

447
00:18:54,383 --> 00:18:55,384
HEY!

448
00:18:55,426 --> 00:18:56,970
SO, I HAD A GREAT DAY.

449
00:18:57,011 --> 00:18:58,805
RICK AND I HIT IT OFF.

450
00:18:58,846 --> 00:19:00,473
WE STARTED MAKING OUT

451
00:19:00,514 --> 00:19:03,017
AND THEN, MY BOSS WALKED IN
AND FIRED ME FOR BEING A WHORE.

452
00:19:03,059 --> 00:19:04,435
WHAT?
WHAT?

453
00:19:04,477 --> 00:19:05,812
YOU GOT FIRED?

454
00:19:05,853 --> 00:19:07,480
IT'S SO WEIRD.

455
00:19:07,521 --> 00:19:10,817
I HAVE NEVER BEEN FIRED
FROM ANYTHING BEFORE.

456
00:19:10,858 --> 00:19:12,276
SWEETIE.

457
00:19:12,318 --> 00:19:14,112
I JUST STARTED
WALKING AROUND

458
00:19:14,153 --> 00:19:16,447
NOT KNOWING WHAT TO
DO NEXT, YOU KNOW?

459
00:19:16,489 --> 00:19:18,950
I STARTED ASKING
PEOPLE ON THE STREET

460
00:19:18,992 --> 00:19:20,618
IF THEY WANTED MASSAGES.

461
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:23,537
THEN THESE POLICEMEN
THOUGHT I WAS A WHORE, TOO.

462
00:19:23,579 --> 00:19:25,123
OH!

463
00:19:25,164 --> 00:19:27,750
IT'S REALLY BEEN
A BAD DAY, WHORE-WISE.

464
00:19:27,792 --> 00:19:30,503
( knocking at door )

465
00:19:33,297 --> 00:19:34,256
HEY, DUCK.

466
00:19:34,298 --> 00:19:36,634
IS CHICK HERE?

467
00:19:36,676 --> 00:19:38,845
YEAH...

468
00:19:38,886 --> 00:19:41,221
BUNNY RABBIT.

469
00:19:42,222 --> 00:19:43,975
YOU READY FOR OUR
LAST PRACTICE?

470
00:19:44,017 --> 00:19:45,392
YEAH, BUT I THINK
THE REASON

471
00:19:45,434 --> 00:19:47,145
WE'RE NOT GETTING
THAT SPIN RIGHT

472
00:19:47,186 --> 00:19:48,980
IS BECAUSE
MY APARTMENT'S TOO SMALL.

473
00:19:49,022 --> 00:19:50,106
WANT TO USE OUR PLACE?

474
00:19:50,148 --> 00:19:51,149
NO.

475
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:52,692
I HAD ANOTHER IDEA.

476
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:59,907
♪ NIGHT AND DAY ♪

477
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:03,202
♪ YOU ARE THE ONE ♪

478
00:20:05,538 --> 00:20:08,374
♪ ONLY YOU BENEATH THE MOON ♪

479
00:20:08,415 --> 00:20:09,959
♪ AND UNDER THE SUN ♪

480
00:20:12,670 --> 00:20:16,924
♪ WHETHER NEAR TO ME OR FAR ♪

481
00:20:16,966 --> 00:20:20,136
♪ IT'S NOT MATTER, DARLING,
WHERE YOU ARE ♪

482
00:20:20,178 --> 00:20:22,930
♪ I THINK OF YOU ♪

483
00:20:22,972 --> 00:20:28,644
♪ NIGHT AND DAY. ♪

484
00:20:34,358 --> 00:20:35,317
WE DID IT!

485
00:20:35,359 --> 00:20:36,527
I KNOW! WE DID IT!

486
00:20:36,569 --> 00:20:38,112
HEY, THAT WAS
INCREDIBLE, HUH?

487
00:20:38,154 --> 00:20:39,155
THAT WAS AMAZING!

488
00:20:39,197 --> 00:20:40,948
I MEAN, WE TOTALLY NAILED IT!

489
00:20:40,990 --> 00:20:42,075
IT WAS BEAUTIFUL.

490
00:20:42,116 --> 00:20:43,076
HEY, LISTEN.

491
00:20:43,117 --> 00:20:45,411
THANKS A LOT, TRIBBIANI.

492
00:20:45,452 --> 00:20:46,579
OH, MY GOD.

493
00:20:46,620 --> 00:20:47,830
LOOK AT THE TIME.

494
00:20:47,872 --> 00:20:49,916
I GOT TO CATCH
THE BUS TO THE BALL.

495
00:20:49,957 --> 00:20:51,709
OH. OKAY.

496
00:20:51,751 --> 00:20:53,252
GOOD LUCK.

497
00:20:53,293 --> 00:20:54,628
YEAH.

498
00:20:54,670 --> 00:20:57,590
UNLESS YOU WANT TO PRACTICE
THE FOX-TROT AGAIN

499
00:20:57,631 --> 00:20:58,758
OR THE TANGO?

500
00:20:58,799 --> 00:21:02,136
UH, THANKS, BUT NO.

501
00:21:02,178 --> 00:21:05,598
YOU SEE, I THINK I'M READY
TO DANCE WITH GIRLS.

502
00:21:05,639 --> 00:21:07,265
OKAY.

503
00:21:07,307 --> 00:21:08,475
GO GET 'EM, TREEGER.

504
00:21:08,517 --> 00:21:09,685
RIGHT.

505
00:21:14,065 --> 00:21:15,608
HEY, UH...

506
00:21:15,649 --> 00:21:16,650
YOU WANT TO COME?

507
00:21:16,692 --> 00:21:17,944
MARGE HAS A GIRLFRIEND.

508
00:21:17,985 --> 00:21:19,112
REALLY?

509
00:21:19,153 --> 00:21:20,196
YEAH.

510
00:21:20,238 --> 00:21:21,572
YOU COULD DANCE WITH HER.

511
00:21:21,614 --> 00:21:23,157
SHE'S THE SAME SIZE AS ME.

512
00:21:23,199 --> 00:21:25,451
NO. I'M GOOD.

513
00:21:42,509 --> 00:21:45,429
SO, IT LOOKS LIKE YOU'VE GOT
SOME GREAT EXPERIENCE HERE.

514
00:21:45,471 --> 00:21:46,472
LET'S SEE.

515
00:21:46,513 --> 00:21:47,932
REASON FOR LEAVING LAST JOB?

516
00:21:47,974 --> 00:21:49,934
YEAH. THEY THOUGHT
I WAS A WHORE.

517
00:21:51,894 --> 00:21:53,187
OKAY.

518
00:21:53,229 --> 00:21:55,397
WE'LL GIVE YOU A CALL
IF ANYTHING COMES UP.

519
00:21:56,398 --> 00:21:57,399
GREAT.

520
00:21:57,441 --> 00:21:59,318
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

521
00:21:59,359 --> 00:22:02,488
